{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f57cfdaa3423982ac99cb2c739d50536ade8181714dd218d7b7e16d5029bb1e3","ja":"10分後……","zh":"10分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7a70c6c6f745d33c3ba24459451592fc1c3704f5320589debe3f1fb73f91d548","ja":"ふう……。琴葉ちゃん、どのセリフもすっごく\nカッコよかったです！　演技に磨きがかかってますね！","zh":"呼……琴叶，每一句台词都超级\n帅气！演技越来越纯熟了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d143d1a2ea30a3d04d17cfcd4a45d41d182b2f26baa25ac4dc533f6164ac22eb","ja":"ありがと。えっと……すごくうれしいんだけど、\n亜利沙、ずっと褒め言葉しか言ってくれてないよね？","zh":"谢谢你。那个……虽然我非常高兴，\n但亚利沙是不是从刚才起就一直在夸我呀？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e6d35202aa59e3a42694d10bebe039d0bd3f4562c6cb7381c0b95551d937486b","ja":"気になることも言ってもらえた方が、\n参考にできるから、ありがたいんだけど……。","zh":"要是能把在意的部分也指出来，\n就能拿来参考，我会更感激的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6144de2027cf0a5f3dbf786df55bffa5ce0724faf92f0142871d93ac176deecd","ja":"ハッ……そ、そうですよね！　せっかくありさにお声を\nかけていただいたというのに、なんたる不覚……！","zh":"啊……没、没错呢！难得亚利沙主动\n来和我说话，我竟然如此疏忽……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"bfeaa569b9af4cc24a0e8b658625023eb559628e9ef05c7e81454aacfc774c0a","ja":"ありさ、心を入れ替えます！\n気になるところを、しっかりお伝えしますね！","zh":"亚利沙会洗心革面的！\n我会在意的地方，好好传达给您的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5d4f7271097897d7562c8dbcc5d1e2dde18cda70b4d31185ea8ed4be2e177489","ja":"ありがとう。それで、さっきのセリフどうかな？\n少し物足りない気がして……。","zh":"谢谢。那个，刚才的台词觉得怎么样？\n总觉得好像还差点什么……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"873612d54543ae11073bb0dd86b83c333c8dcdf746d215c89761492030c48662","ja":"そうですね……主人公に言うセリフですが……。","zh":"是啊……这是对主角说的台词……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"606edc755e3bf903f0fa87e28b3886e097cd048be7221263ee19e809b325e06b","ja":"他の女の子と話す時と\nあまり変わりがないのが、気になりました。","zh":"和其他女孩子说话时\n感觉没什么两样，这让我有点在意。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"dc7be9595ae745fda0ab2953d880534cf614503e6a48b92211b3de77ae5081bb","ja":"なるほど……そうだよね。好きな子への言葉なんだから\n本心は切ないはず……。なら山場のセリフも……。","zh":"原来如此……也是呢。因为是对喜欢的人说的话，\n内心深处其实很伤感才对……那高潮部分的台词也……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d7a3b4d32070ebb7bff450dfdace93418f2bba22b2924f69ce180f35a7b8d13b","ja":"「ねぇ、どうしたら信じてもらえるわけ？\nオレ、キミのこと……ほんとに大好き、なんだけど」","zh":"“呐，到底要怎样你才会相信我啊？\n我……真的很喜欢你呢。”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a839956ed107bee5fb91e52fbb17f2eb1ae76c3cf47154a2e6551e8bbc8e68f4","ja":"ふおぉぉぉ～～～っ！？\nあ、あわわわわわわぁ～～～～～！？","zh":"哇哦哦哦～～～！？\n哇、哇哇哇哇哇哇～～～～～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"93dff4d1811922cdfd888ff29ffdd9e5afc6f3d0c441db0fb920487a4af3a8f6","ja":"ええっ！？　ど、どうしたの、大丈夫！？\nど、どこか具合が悪いとか？","zh":"咦！？怎、怎么了，没事吧！？\n是、是哪里不舒服吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"17d254247c89fabb099401f78b6104acea114daeae822c0d08ff6df2b6c4a6a2","ja":"ふぅ、ふぅ……ご、ご心配なく！　あまりの破壊力に\n……ふぅ。キュンキュン、しすぎただけですので！","zh":"呼、呼……请、请别担心！只是破坏力实在太强\n……呼。让人太心动了而已！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1545.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"120d3fd8badb8245b00306caa1a92f5792aa311e5880311d01df45e5900a336b","ja":"すごいです、琴葉ちゃん！　これなら絶対、\nみんながときめきMAXになりますよ～っ！","zh":"太厉害了，琴叶！这样一来，\n大家绝对会心动MAX的～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
